Rāma bids Lakṣmaṇa seal boy in scented oil jar --- Rāma summons Puṣpaka and honors sages --- Rāma arms with bow sword and trusts city to brothers --- Rāma searches west north and east sinless --- Rāma reaches southern lake north of Śaivala --- Rāma finds ascetic hanging head-down in lake --- Rāma asks caste motive and truthful answer